sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Customer (Browser/Mobile)
    participant Client as Single Page App (Client)
    participant GW as API Gateway / Reverse Proxy
    participant Auth as Identity & Auth Service
    participant Order as Order Processing Service
    participant DB as Relational Database (PostgreSQL)
    participant Broker as Message Broker (Kafka/RabbitMQ)
    participant Payment as External Payment Provider

    Note over User,Client: Phase 1: Authentication & Token Verification
    User->>Client: Submit Checkout Form (Items, Shipping)
    activate Client
    Client->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders (Payload + JWT access token)
    activate GW
    GW->>Auth: Validate Token & Scopes (Introspection)
    activate Auth
    alt Token is Valid & Active
        Auth-->>GW: 200 OK (Claims: userId, roles, tenantId)
    else Token Expired or Tampered
        Auth-->>GW: 401 Unauthorized (Error: INVALID_CREDENTIALS)
        GW-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        Client-->>User: Prompt Session Refresh / Relogin
    end
    deactivate Auth

    Note over GW,Order: Phase 2: Transaction Initiation & Idempotency Check
    GW->>Order: POST /internal/orders (Payload + Context Headers)
    activate Order
    Order->>DB: SELECT * FROM idempotency_keys WHERE key = :idempotencyKey
    activate DB
    DB-->>Order: Record not found (New transaction allowed)
    deactivate DB

    Order->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    Order->>DB: INSERT INTO orders (id, user_id, status, total) VALUES (...)
    Order->>DB: INSERT INTO outbox_events (id, aggregate_type, payload) VALUES (...)
    Order->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB-->>Order: Transaction Committed (Order ID: ord_01H8X)
    deactivate DB

    Note over Order,Payment: Phase 3: External Payment Capture
    Order->>Payment: POST /v1/charges (Amount, Currency, CardToken)
    activate Payment
    alt Payment Succeeded
        Payment-->>Order: 200 OK (Transaction: ch_3N8xYz, Status: SUCCEEDED)
        Order->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status = 'PAID' WHERE id = 'ord_01H8X'
        activate DB
        DB-->>Order: Row Updated (1 row)
        deactivate DB

        Note over Order,Broker: Phase 4: Asynchronous Integration Event Publishing
        Order-)Broker: Publish 'order.paid' Event (Partition Key: ord_01H8X)
        activate Broker
        Broker-->>Order: ACK (Offset: 489201)
        deactivate Broker

        Order-->>GW: 201 Created (Order DTO + Receipt URL)
        GW-->>Client: 201 Created (Order Confirmation)
        Client-->>User: Render Order Success & Tracking View
    else Payment Declined / Insufficient Funds
        Payment-->>Order: 402 Payment Required (DeclineCode: INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS)
        Order->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status = 'PAYMENT_FAILED' WHERE id = 'ord_01H8X'
        activate DB
        DB-->>Order: Row Updated (1 row)
        deactivate DB
        Order-->>GW: 402 Payment Required (ErrorCode: PAYMENT_DECLINED)
        GW-->>Client: 402 Payment Required
        Client-->>User: Display Payment Decline Message & Retry Options
    end
    deactivate Payment
    deactivate Order
    deactivate GW
    deactivate Client
